<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>手艺 on Yousa Driven Development | YDD</title><link>https://yousali.com/tags/%E6%89%8B%E8%89%BA/</link><description>Recent content in 手艺 on Yousa Driven Development | YDD</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.148.1</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:33:45 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yousali.com/tags/%E6%89%8B%E8%89%BA/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>没有图纸的两百年前老钟，王津靠手感和耳朵听出症结</title><link>https://yousali.com/stories/wang-jin-palace-clock-restoration/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yousali.com/stories/wang-jin-palace-clock-restoration/</guid><description>故宫钟表修复师王津四十多年修了数百件无图纸清代古钟，靠指尖阻尼与齿轮声辨别毛病，但这份分寸难以写成手册，也无法硬修残损过重的孤品。</description></item><item><title>师傅不教只让拧热毛巾，小野二郎靠偷看熬出九年学徒期</title><link>https://yousali.com/stories/jiro-ono-apprentice-craft/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yousali.com/stories/jiro-ono-apprentice-craft/</guid><description>从7岁在福田屋打杂到25岁进东京与志乃学徒，小野二郎在师傅不开口的厨房里靠偷看刀工与火候攒下做寿司的手艺。</description></item></channel></rss>